# Manuscript handover

Read the guide before editing. Re-count the live file if its size or paragraph count differs from the guide. Paragraph indexes move; trust anchor sentences.

Before a person, a place, a joke, or a physics claim goes into any book in this series, read `SERIES_BIBLE.md`. The sections that bind the voice are "Tone and humour" and "People who continue." A book guide may not override the bible. Do not give a returning person a new smell, a new instrument, or a new name. Do not redecorate a place the bible already furnished. Add a new person or room to the bible in the same edit that puts them on the page.

## Live files

- Book 1: `Book 1 - Schrodingers Paperwork/Schrodingers_Paperwork_BOOK_1_KINDLE_FINAL.docx`. Guide: `Book 1 - Schrodingers Paperwork/notes/MANUSCRIPT_GUIDE.md`. Places: `Book 1 - Schrodingers Paperwork/notes/CHARACTER_AND_PLACE_GUIDE.md`.
- Book 2: `Book 2 - The Permitted Options/The_Permitted_Options_BOOK_2_DRAFT.docx`. Guide: `Book 2 - The Permitted Options/notes/MANUSCRIPT_GUIDE.md`.
- Series notes: `notes/SERIES_BIBLE.md`, `notes/HANDOVER.md`. Layout: one master docx + KDP files per book root; `chapters/`, `scripts/`, `notes/`, `bak/` under each book. Docx only, no epub/PDF.

## Not the live book

- Book 1 `Schrodingers_Paperwork_BOOK_1_KINDLE_FINAL.voice-unruh-brillouin.docx` and any `*.before-*.docx` (all now in `bak/`).
- Book 2 `bak/The_Permitted_Options_BOOK_2_DRAFT.docx` (pre-name-fix). Never overwrite it. Other `bak/before-*` files are snapshots. The original RTF is an abandoned Neville/Weinstein draft.
- The parent folder `Schrodingers_Paperwork/` is a different tree. The series Book 1 is the path above.

## While editing

- Curly quotes only. Reset quote state at each paragraph. A quote right after an em dash closes. Do not collapse runs in a paragraph that has a hyperlink.
- New prose inserted after a heading must be set to Body Text. Cloning a heading's style puts the new paragraph in the Kindle contents.
- Book 2 glossary entries and bibliography entries are Body Text. Heading 2 in the back is `The Lectures`, `Lecture. Chapter One` through `Lecture. Chapter Sixteen`, `Glossary`, and `Bibliography`.
- The lectures stay after Q.E.D., in chapter order. Do not put `You need first`, `When you walk out`, `Start here`, or `The idea, step by step` back into the chapters.
- Do not restore Book 2 working titles, one-line summaries, "Stop. Before you go on", or continuity notes. Those deletions stop before "The Permitted Options ends here" and "Q.E.D."
- Do not commit or push unless the user asks. Parent git root is `My Books for Amazon`. Do not force-push.
